&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 to 5 years of experience in general accounting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record managing multi-entity and/or international accounting scopes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience preparing regulatory tax filings and working with external auditors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong command of general ledger accounting and month-end close processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage intercompany transactions and foreign subsidiary accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Payroll accounting and social charges compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tax compliance (VAT, CVAE, C3S)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorous, autonomous, and comfortable working in a fast-scaling environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Tools Used&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oracle Suite (ERP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-powered tools (including Dust)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
